0. 0.  0. 0.  0. 0.            ! bcvel(0:1,1:3,2) [v BC value]
0. 0.  0. 0.  0. 0.            ! bcvel(0:1,1:3,3) [w BC value]
0. 0.  0. 0.  0. 0.            ! bcpre(0:1,1:3  ) [p BC value]
